      "text": [
        " شَيْءٍ ثُمَّ يُعَادُ فِي اَلْمَاءِ فَيَمُوتُ فِيهِ فَقَالَ \"لاَ تَأْكُلْ لِأَنَّهُ مَاتَ فِي اَلَّذِي فِيهِ حَيَاتُهُ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4154 - Abd al-Rahman ibn Sayabah asked him about fish that are caught, placed in something, and then returned to the water where they die.\nImam (as) said: \"Do not eat it, because it died in what is its source of life.\""
        ]
      }
